          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Innovation. Inside and out. Experience the value of gel technology.</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">It’s true: Pressure injuries can begin in as little as the first two hours* of a patient’s admittance into a clinical setting. They pose a serious threat and should be treated as such.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">With the aforementioned knowledge of the severity of pressure injuries in mind, we designed IsoFlex SE with specific features to aid in treatment and prevention. Most important of these features, is gel.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 20 2024 16:55:23 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-fe8967f731@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Apr 24 2020 19:55:12 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>A</b> ShearGel<br>\n <b>B</b> CoreGel<br>\n <b>C</b> Sloped heel section</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 20 2024 16:55:01 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
