          "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 02 2018 16:06:05 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Sloped heel section</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">IsoFlex SE features a sloped heel section to further address our commitment to pressure injury prevention by helping reduce the risk of heel breakdown.</span></p>\n",
