          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Three-sided zipper</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Three-sided zipperCaregivers can fully inspect the condition of internal components of their stretcher surface with IsoFlex SE’s three-sided zipper.</span></p>\n",
